; Description
; Give your characters a bit more personality through random emotes.
;
; Emotes are triggered automatically while you're idle (AFK).
; You can decide which emotes are included, disable the ones you don’t like, and choose from standard or your collection.
; Mark your favourites to have them appear more often.
; Includes ready-made presets like Dancer, Musician, and Goofball, plus up to three Custom presets you can tailor to your own style.
; Customize idle time and delay, or trigger emotes manually at any time. You can browse a full list of your emotes directly in the settings.
;
; Tip: If you want to enjoy many unexpected funny situations, use the Goofball preset during quests or idle time.
